        "content": "<p>I am using ChatGPT Pro through the Codex VS Code extension to formalize some results, both by other people and by myself.</p>\n<p>I would not call this full auto-formalization: I usually start with LaTeX sources or screenshots of a single result, and then guide the AI whenever necessary. A discussion here suggested that having a well-written <code>AGENTS.md</code> file could be quite helpful, and I think this is a good idea.</p>\n<p>Does anyone have suggestions for what such a file should contain? Or would anyone be willing to share theirs?</p>\n<p>Just to start the experiment/conversation, I wrote the following one, although I have not tested it yet.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AGENTS</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">md</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">##</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Project</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Directives</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Prefer</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">minimal</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">focused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">changes</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Follow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">existing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">project</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">patterns</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">before</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">adding</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">new</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">abstractions</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dependencies</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Avoid</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unrelated</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">refactors</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">generated</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">churn</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Treat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">user</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">changes</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">working</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tree</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intentional</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">unless</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">explicitly</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">told</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">otherwise</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Make</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">code</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reusable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">other</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">projects</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">as</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">possible</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">It</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">should</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">be</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">readable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">and</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">easy</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reuse</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Follow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Style</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Guidelines</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">https</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"bp\">//</span><span class=\"n\">leanprover</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">community</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">github</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">io</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">contribute</span><span class=\"bp\">/</span><span class=\"n\">style</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">html</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">axioms</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">admits</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`sorry</span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">when</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">appropriate</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">divide</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> 