    {
        "content": "<p>Hi, thanks for sharing! </p>\n<p>For my modest experiments, the biggest game changer was to give it access to <a href=\"https://github.com/oOo0oOo/lean-lsp-mcp\">lean-lsp-mcp</a> together with these skills:  <a href=\"https://github.com/cameronfreer/lean4-skills\">lean4-skills</a>. Flash-like models can iterate quickly and make progress surprisingly fast using these.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/Xv-QkJXQzhD2PtX496a-kK_p/minify.mp4\">minify.mp4</a><br>\n<a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/iO-OE1Iko71PNN4mEPTXjgUZ/clique.mp4\">clique.mp4</a></p>\n<div class=\"message_inline_image message_inline_video\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/Xv-QkJXQzhD2PtX496a-kK_p/minify.mp4\" title=\"minify.mp4\"><video preload=\"metadata\" src=\"/user_uploads/3121/Xv-QkJXQzhD2PtX496a-kK_p/minify.mp4\"></video></a></div><div class=\"message_inline_image message_inline_video\"><a href=\"/user_uploads/3121/iO-OE1Iko71PNN4mEPTXjgUZ/clique.mp4\" title=\"clique.mp4\"><video preload=\"metadata\" src=\"/user_uploads/3121/iO-OE1Iko71PNN4mEPTXjgUZ/clique.mp4\"></video></a></div><p>P.S: Perhaps this convo is better suited in this channel: <a class=\"stream\" data-stream-id=\"583338\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/583338-Prompting.2C-skills.2C-and-agent-tools\">#Prompting, skills, and agent tools</a></p>",
